### sample items (legacy)
GET https://localhost:8081/api/catalog/items

### ping / liveness
GET https://localhost:8081/api/catalog/ping

### list all products
GET https://localhost:8081/api/catalog

### get one product
GET https://localhost:8081/api/catalog/CAT-1

### create product
POST https://localhost:8081/api/catalog
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Stapler",
  "category": "Office",
  "price": 12.90,
  "stock": 30
}

### update product
PUT https://localhost:8081/api/catalog/CAT-2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 1.50,
  "stock": 450
}

### delete product
DELETE https://localhost:8081/api/catalog/CAT-2

### secondary instance
GET https://localhost:8082/api/catalog/items
